{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087860/extras/titleMP.png?t=1745271849\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a pig in the Middle Ages who has been kidnapped from your home and is being taken somewhere. You barely remember your past, and the world around you is unfamiliar and alien. Miraculously escaping from your captors, you must embark on a perilous journey through uncharted lands! Discover their secrets and regain your memory! Can a pig achieve such feats? Oink!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087860/extras/2025-01-30_21-58-39_2.gif?t=1745271849\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087860/extras/aboutMP.png?t=1745271849\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>In this adventure, you will:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Craft items </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build houses </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete quests </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Patiently listen to dialogues </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">And, of course, fight for your piggy life! <br><br>Before you lies a fully open world. Go in any direction your piggy heart desires! Complete or ignore quests as you wish, but remember, your decisions can lead to the most unexpected consequences!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3087860/extras/2025-01-30_21-58-39.gif?t=1745271849\" /></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3087860?t=1745271849","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3087860?t=174527184